From: genshanxinli <127909456+genshanxinli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fakeroot: wait for faked TCP port before invoking child

faked prints its TCP port before the forked daemon reaches accept(), causing
the first client (e.g. apk mkpkg) to fail with "connect: Connection refused".
Wait up to 2 s for the port to accept a connection using /dev/tcp under bash
or python3 under POSIX shells such as dash.

Origin: backport, archive/xr1710g-v1
Signed-off-by: genshanxinli <127909456+genshanxinli@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/scripts/fakeroot.in
+++ b/scripts/fakeroot.in
@@ -149,6 +149,29 @@
 FAKEROOTKEY=`echo $KEY_PID|cut -d: -f1`
 PID=`echo $KEY_PID|cut -d: -f2`
 
+# Wait up to 2 s for faked to reach accept() using bash /dev/tcp or python3.
+if test -n "$FAKEROOTKEY"; then
+  if test -n "$BASH_VERSION"; then
+    i=0
+    while test $i -lt 200; do
+      (exec 3<>/dev/tcp/127.0.0.1/"$FAKEROOTKEY") 2>/dev/null && break
+      i=`expr $i + 1`
+      sleep 0.01 2>/dev/null
+    done
+  elif command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1; then
+    python3 -c 'import socket, sys, time
+deadline = time.time() + 2.0
+while True:
+    try:
+        socket.create_connection(("127.0.0.1", int(sys.argv[1])), 0.2).close()
+        sys.exit(0)
+    except OSError:
+        if time.time() >= deadline:
+            sys.exit(1)
+        time.sleep(0.005)' "$FAKEROOTKEY"
+  fi
+fi
+
 if [ "$WAITINTRAP" -eq 0 ]; then
   trap "kill -s @signal@ $PID" EXIT INT
 else
